WEBVTT

00:00:32.625 --> 00:00:33.875
That's yours, right?

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:44.958
- Enjoy.
- Thanks.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:47.167
Preeti.

00:00:58.167 --> 00:01:00.750
Listen, I'm sorry.
I probably shouldn't have come.

00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:04.833
You must be thinking why I…

00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:06.667
You had to come someday.

00:01:08.208 --> 00:01:09.625
To see Musafir Cafe?

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:11.750
Right?

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:17.042
Is this how you imagined it?

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:21.125
It's much, much better.

00:01:26.292 --> 00:01:27.958
Chander isn't here.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.833
He'll be back tomorrow.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.875
You know, before coming here,

00:01:37.958 --> 00:01:40.708
I booked and cancelled the tickets
three different times.

00:01:42.667 --> 00:01:45.542
But I'm leaving India soon.

00:01:46.542 --> 00:01:49.167
So, I thought maybe I should…

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.208
Listen, Preeti.

00:01:53.042 --> 00:01:55.125
I'm not here to disrupt anything.

00:01:56.625 --> 00:01:58.083
I hope you know that.

00:02:00.333 --> 00:02:02.208
Every now and then, I had a feeling…

00:02:04.042 --> 00:02:05.333
that you'd come.

00:02:08.542 --> 00:02:09.500
So…

00:02:10.833 --> 00:02:12.792
did he tell you everything about me?

00:02:13.417 --> 00:02:14.417
No.

00:02:16.708 --> 00:02:18.583
I just know that

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.542
if Sudha weren't in Chander's life,

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:24.542
there would be no Musafir Cafe.

00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:26.083
No.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.792
Musafir Cafe exists because he met you.

00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:33.000
Because you stood by him.

00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:38.792
I'm just one small chapter
in his life story.

00:02:40.167 --> 00:02:41.875
A very important chapter.

00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:46.208
The chapter he never forgot.

00:02:54.167 --> 00:02:55.917
May I say something, Sudha?

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.208
Yes, of course.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:03.042
You know, I never tried to replace you.

00:03:05.125 --> 00:03:08.500
Because no one can take your place
in Chander's heart.

00:03:13.625 --> 00:03:15.583
Preeti, it was really nice to meet you.

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:22.125
But you know what?
I think I should go.

00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:23.917
And…

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.167
If possible, please don't tell him
I was here, okay?

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:28.958
No, Sudha, wait.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.167
Listen.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.000
I don't know exactly what happened
between you two.

00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:37.833
And I don't have to know.

00:03:40.417 --> 00:03:45.292
I only know that eight years
is a very long time.

00:03:47.375 --> 00:03:51.958
And I can imagine how hard it must
have been for you to come here.

00:03:57.708 --> 00:03:59.208
Just meet Chander once.

00:04:56.458 --> 00:04:58.000
{\an8}I went to the doctor.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:10.958
It was a false alarm.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.083
The doctor said it happens
with home tests.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:25.458
How are you?

00:05:27.667 --> 00:05:28.917
Do you want the truth or a lie?

00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:37.292
Having a baby…

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.458
was never part of my plan.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:43.917
I know. I know.

00:05:44.417 --> 00:05:47.250
Meeting you wasn't part of my plan either.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:54.042
And now you think
meeting me was a mistake.

00:05:54.125 --> 00:05:55.458
I didn't say that.

00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:01.292
I'm very sorry, Sudha.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.958
You know, Chander,

00:06:07.125 --> 00:06:09.292
I showed you the pregnancy test.

00:06:10.667 --> 00:06:12.083
You looked at it…

00:06:13.875 --> 00:06:17.000
and the very first thing
you mentioned was marriage.

00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:21.625
You didn't ask how I was feeling.

00:06:22.167 --> 00:06:25.417
I'm very, very, very sorry, Sudha. I…

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:29.042
No, Chander.
I'm the one who should be sorry.

00:06:31.167 --> 00:06:33.750
Because only today did I realize that

00:06:34.583 --> 00:06:37.292
you've been compromising
in this relationship.

00:06:39.125 --> 00:06:40.750
- Compromise?
- Yes.

00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:43.167
No, Sudha, there's no compromise.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.708
- What are you saying?
- Then what was that, Chander?

00:06:47.292 --> 00:06:49.958
How can marriage be the solution
to every problem?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:56.875
I can't think about marriage
at this point in my life.

00:06:56.958 --> 00:06:59.375
- And you know that!
- I know. I know.

00:07:00.125 --> 00:07:02.375
I know that… I don't know.

00:07:02.458 --> 00:07:05.583
I don't know why I brought up marriage--

00:07:05.667 --> 00:07:07.917
Because that's what's in your heart!

00:07:15.917 --> 00:07:20.500
A home, marriage, a wife, kids,

00:07:21.042 --> 00:07:23.458
a beautiful cafe
tucked away in the mountains.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.500
That's your dream.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:29.917
You're making the same mistake you made
in your last relationship.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.875
You're changing yourself for me.

00:07:46.042 --> 00:07:47.125
Chander,

00:07:47.667 --> 00:07:51.333
in the mountains,
I saw a kind of peace within you

00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:54.417
that I've never even felt myself.

00:07:56.542 --> 00:07:58.042
Please don't let that go.

00:08:01.583 --> 00:08:03.833
No, you're right. You're right.

00:08:05.625 --> 00:08:06.875
You're right.

00:08:13.292 --> 00:08:15.958
Love changes me.

00:08:16.667 --> 00:08:18.333
I always lose myself.

00:08:21.792 --> 00:08:22.958
But you…

00:08:26.083 --> 00:08:28.458
You're standing right
where you were on day one.

00:08:30.542 --> 00:08:35.375
Your career, your plan, your dreams.

00:08:36.833 --> 00:08:38.000
Tell me something.

00:08:39.333 --> 00:08:41.542
Which of these is your real plan?

00:08:42.375 --> 00:08:45.750
Taking care of your mom,
traveling the world, making money?

00:08:45.833 --> 00:08:48.167
Or are all these things just an excuse

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.500
because Sudha Tripathi has decided

00:08:50.583 --> 00:08:52.792
that she cannot do this with me anymore?

00:08:53.542 --> 00:08:56.417
Have you ever stopped to think,
even for a minute, Sudha,

00:08:58.125 --> 00:08:59.792
that maybe you could be wrong?

00:09:00.375 --> 00:09:05.250
That maybe this perfect plan in your head
isn't so perfect after all?

00:09:06.542 --> 00:09:07.625
Fuck you and your plan.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:10.792
Why don't you tell me the truth?

00:09:11.833 --> 00:09:13.917
That, "Chander, I'm done with you!"

00:09:15.458 --> 00:09:18.208
"I had nowhere to stay,
and I needed a house, so I came."

00:09:18.292 --> 00:09:21.083
"Now, I'm going to Mumbai.
I'll find someone else there."

00:09:22.792 --> 00:09:24.000
Tell the truth.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.292
That maybe what we have
isn't true love at all.

00:09:53.625 --> 00:09:54.833
Sit, sit.

00:09:55.458 --> 00:09:58.083
If you need anything, just call, okay?

00:09:58.167 --> 00:09:59.208
Thanks.

00:09:59.292 --> 00:10:00.667
Make yourself at home.

00:10:04.208 --> 00:10:05.167
Good night.

00:11:22.333 --> 00:11:25.000
Everyone has heard your songs
here in Uttarakhand.

00:11:25.083 --> 00:11:26.958
- Thank you, sir.
- She's a good singer, sir.

00:11:27.042 --> 00:11:28.792
Yes, very nice. We're your fans.

00:11:28.875 --> 00:11:31.750
- Thank you so much, sir.
- Did you get to look around?

00:11:33.208 --> 00:11:34.875
Look, you're in the mountains.

00:11:34.958 --> 00:11:37.458
Wherever you look, there's a view.

00:11:38.167 --> 00:11:41.292
But still, we've shortlisted
a few tourist spots around here.

00:11:41.375 --> 00:11:44.375
We even have brochures for them.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.167
For taxis, places to visit,

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:49.833
and places to eat.
I'll just send you the brochure.

00:12:14.958 --> 00:12:16.625
Yes, that's Landour.

00:12:16.708 --> 00:12:18.833
And if you want a nice lunch,

00:12:18.917 --> 00:12:21.167
Landour Bakehouse is right there, and--

00:12:28.719 --> 00:12:31.958
All right, okay.
So, sir, we'll see you in the evening?

00:12:34.542 --> 00:12:35.458
Yes.

00:12:35.542 --> 00:12:37.958
- All right, sir, thank you.
- Yeah.

00:12:38.667 --> 00:12:39.708
Thank you.

00:12:42.167 --> 00:12:43.292
<i>Where are you going now?</i>

00:12:43.958 --> 00:12:44.833
To Gargi's.

00:12:44.917 --> 00:12:46.083
- Why?
- Why?

00:12:46.708 --> 00:12:49.125
If you think I don't love you,

00:12:49.708 --> 00:12:53.833
then I have no right to stay in this house
and you have no right to ask me why.

00:12:53.917 --> 00:12:55.833
Besides, Chander,
I have to leave in two weeks anyway.

00:12:55.917 --> 00:12:57.708
So, I might as well leave today.

00:12:57.792 --> 00:12:59.125
What's the need to wait?

00:12:59.792 --> 00:13:00.875
Sudha.

00:13:00.958 --> 00:13:03.000
- Okay, I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.
- Please…

00:13:03.083 --> 00:13:04.458
- I just--
- Stop, please stop!

00:13:04.542 --> 00:13:06.958
- I said it in anger.
- Chander, what are we doing?

00:13:09.125 --> 00:13:11.542
The way we're behaving with each other,

00:13:12.417 --> 00:13:14.292
that's neither you nor me.

00:13:15.708 --> 00:13:18.375
Let's stop. Let's just end this.

00:13:19.375 --> 00:13:22.250
You quitting your job for me
and moving to Mumbai…

00:13:22.333 --> 00:13:25.625
There's an expectation behind it
that I can't fulfil.

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.250
Not right now.

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:29.792
And maybe never.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.250
Sudha…

00:13:40.042 --> 00:13:41.958
Sudha! Sudha, please stop!

00:13:42.042 --> 00:13:43.792
Chander, please don't stop me.

00:13:43.875 --> 00:13:45.667
Sudha, how can I not stop you?

00:13:46.375 --> 00:13:47.667
I love you, Sudha!

00:14:05.625 --> 00:14:07.167
I love you too, Chander.

00:14:08.083 --> 00:14:09.292
Please don't go.

00:14:17.125 --> 00:14:20.208
Chander, promise me
you won't come after me.

00:14:20.292 --> 00:14:21.292
Sudha, please.

00:14:21.375 --> 00:14:23.542
Chander, you can find true love

00:14:24.875 --> 00:14:27.167
like I found with you.

00:14:28.333 --> 00:14:31.500
But who said true love is right for us?

00:14:32.116 --> 00:14:33.042
Please don't say that.

00:14:36.708 --> 00:14:37.750
Sudha!

00:14:38.875 --> 00:14:39.750
Sudha!

00:14:45.083 --> 00:14:46.167
Sudha…

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.500
Sudha, please don't leave me.

00:14:54.375 --> 00:14:56.333
I won't be able to do this without you.

00:14:59.875 --> 00:15:00.917
You will.

00:15:02.292 --> 00:15:04.792
And I promise I'll come
to see you one more time.

00:15:06.417 --> 00:15:08.417
To drink your special chai one more time.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.542
Sudha, please.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:11.750
Please.

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:18.708
Please.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.792
Please! Sudha!

00:15:20.875 --> 00:15:22.625
Sudha, please! Sudha!

00:15:24.292 --> 00:15:25.375
Sudha!

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.042
Sudha…

00:15:32.917 --> 00:15:39.583
<i>Parting from you was never my choice</i>

00:15:40.292 --> 00:15:47.167
<i>Without you here</i>
<i>I'll live with a shattered heart</i>

00:15:47.708 --> 00:15:54.542
<i>Parting from you was never my choice</i>

00:15:55.125 --> 00:16:02.083
<i>Without you here</i>
<i>I'll live with a shattered heart</i>

00:16:14.292 --> 00:16:15.500
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:16:16.167 --> 00:16:17.292
I'm fine.

00:16:22.083 --> 00:16:24.000
Why didn't you tell me last night?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:30.542
Chander, go and meet Sudha.

00:16:31.667 --> 00:16:33.375
I was the one who asked her to stay.

00:16:33.458 --> 00:16:34.542
Why?

00:16:36.833 --> 00:16:38.875
Someone once told me that

00:16:39.958 --> 00:16:42.333
the body's cells change every seven years.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.417
It's been eight years since you two met.

00:16:51.625 --> 00:16:53.917
Go. Meet her.

00:16:56.083 --> 00:16:57.333
I'm fine.

00:17:30.583 --> 00:17:33.750
<i>- Bhaiya,</i> where did that guy go?
- Who?

00:17:35.458 --> 00:17:37.958
- Chander.
- He's probably in the cafe.

00:17:38.583 --> 00:17:39.792
Okay.

00:18:27.917 --> 00:18:29.875
- Hi.
- Hi.

00:18:33.417 --> 00:18:34.833
Make me some tea?

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.292
Yeah, of course.

00:19:16.792 --> 00:19:20.997
{\an8}SUDHA, PLEASE ANSWER THE PHONE.
JUST TALK TO ME ONCE

00:19:21.125 --> 00:19:22.667
{\an8}JUST GIVE ME TWO MINUTES TO TALK TO YOU

00:19:56.875 --> 00:19:58.750
<i>- Hello?</i>
- Hello.

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:01.375
Hello, Aunty. Namaste.

00:20:01.458 --> 00:20:02.708
I…

00:20:03.833 --> 00:20:05.417
This is Chander.

00:20:05.917 --> 00:20:09.042
Sudha's friend from Bhopal.

00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:10.958
<i>Yes, son?</i>

00:20:11.958 --> 00:20:14.500
Aunty, I don't know if…

00:20:16.167 --> 00:20:19.917
what I'm doing is right or wrong.

00:20:20.458 --> 00:20:21.625
But, Aunty…

00:20:23.667 --> 00:20:26.833
what Sudha is doing is completely wrong.

00:20:26.917 --> 00:20:28.667
<i>It's completely wrong.</i>

00:20:29.208 --> 00:20:32.417
<i>You tell me.</i>
<i>Who just leaves like that, Aunty?</i>

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.792
<i>Please talk some sense into her, Aunty.</i>

00:20:34.875 --> 00:20:35.958
<i>Please talk to her.</i>

00:20:36.458 --> 00:20:39.333
<i>And she stresses out a lot, Aunty.</i>

00:20:40.625 --> 00:20:41.625
<i>About you.</i>

00:20:42.167 --> 00:20:46.708
<i>She hasn't even gotten married</i>
<i>because of you.</i>

00:20:47.792 --> 00:20:53.000
Because of you.
Because she wants to take care of you.

00:20:53.083 --> 00:20:57.375
Aunty, please don't be offended
by what I'm about to say.

00:20:57.458 --> 00:20:59.042
She's your daughter, but…

00:20:59.792 --> 00:21:04.167
please try to understand
where I'm coming from.

00:21:05.625 --> 00:21:07.042
I exist too.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.542
<i>Actually, Aunty,</i>

00:21:12.167 --> 00:21:14.417
chose duty over love.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:15.958
<i>For you.</i>

00:21:16.708 --> 00:21:17.750
Chander!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.875
Oh, Sudha.

00:21:20.958 --> 00:21:24.292
Sudha, I've been trying to call you.

00:21:24.375 --> 00:21:27.958
How dare you call my mom
in a drunken state?

00:21:28.042 --> 00:21:28.917
Sudha…

00:21:29.667 --> 00:21:32.750
Chander, there are some boundaries
you just don't cross.

00:21:33.375 --> 00:21:34.792
<i>And today, you crossed one.</i>

00:21:35.583 --> 00:21:40.333
I will always choose my mother over you,
over anyone, no matter what.

00:21:42.583 --> 00:21:44.708
Don't you dare call me
ever again, Chander!

00:21:44.792 --> 00:21:46.083
- Sudha.
- Sudha.

00:21:46.667 --> 00:21:49.042
- Sudha, please.
- And don't you dare come looking for me!

00:21:49.958 --> 00:21:52.375
We are bloody over, Chander!
We are over!

00:22:32.708 --> 00:22:34.833
Your dream came true, Chander.

00:22:37.375 --> 00:22:39.667
Well, I worked really hard to get here.

00:22:40.292 --> 00:22:41.458
I know.

00:22:45.542 --> 00:22:47.333
You're exactly the same.

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:49.917
But you've changed a lot.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.042
Really?

00:22:51.583 --> 00:22:52.500
How?

00:22:53.125 --> 00:22:55.083
It's like you've found yourself.

00:23:01.917 --> 00:23:03.792
So, enjoying Mumbai?

00:23:04.625 --> 00:23:05.500
Very much.

00:23:06.917 --> 00:23:08.583
I have my own law firm in Mumbai now.

00:23:08.667 --> 00:23:09.625
Yeah, I know.

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:11.875
I practice international law now.

00:23:12.625 --> 00:23:14.417
High-profile cases.

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.625
Everything I never even dreamed of.

00:23:18.542 --> 00:23:20.083
I'm really proud of you.

00:23:21.583 --> 00:23:22.750
Thank you.

00:23:24.875 --> 00:23:26.000
But you know,

00:23:26.708 --> 00:23:29.208
sometimes I remember your stories
about America.

00:23:30.542 --> 00:23:33.667
I have a career and money in Mumbai,

00:23:35.458 --> 00:23:36.917
but not this feeling

00:23:37.833 --> 00:23:40.333
these mountains give you.

00:23:40.875 --> 00:23:42.292
- Right?
- Yeah.

00:23:43.583 --> 00:23:45.708
These mountains are something special.

00:23:48.875 --> 00:23:51.583
These mountains show a person
where they truly belong.

00:23:55.208 --> 00:23:58.542
Everyone in the city
is chasing something, but here…

00:24:00.542 --> 00:24:02.083
just existing is enough.

00:24:07.208 --> 00:24:09.917
- So, shall we?
- Where?

00:24:11.583 --> 00:24:13.875
Let's greet your mountains in peace.

00:24:53.833 --> 00:24:55.208
It's pretty cold, isn't it?

00:24:58.625 --> 00:24:59.833
Why are you laughing?

00:25:00.875 --> 00:25:04.250
When there's nothing left to say,
one should talk about the weather.

00:25:04.750 --> 00:25:05.875
- Right?
- Really?

00:25:06.375 --> 00:25:07.500
What will that do?

00:25:08.583 --> 00:25:09.833
It'll make it seem

00:25:10.500 --> 00:25:12.833
like we haven't run out of things to say.

00:25:22.917 --> 00:25:24.417
Chander, are you happy?

00:25:26.083 --> 00:25:27.208
I'm grateful.

00:25:30.208 --> 00:25:31.542
Can I ask you something?

00:25:32.833 --> 00:25:34.833
Why didn't you marry Preeti?

00:25:36.458 --> 00:25:38.458
I met her at the cafe last night.

00:25:40.250 --> 00:25:41.458
She's really nice.

00:25:42.333 --> 00:25:43.792
A lot nicer than you.

00:25:46.167 --> 00:25:48.167
Tell me. Why didn't you?

00:25:50.250 --> 00:25:52.583
I hadn't divorced you yet, that's why.

00:25:53.125 --> 00:25:55.542
When did we get married to get a divorce?

00:25:55.625 --> 00:25:59.000
We got married so many times.
Did you forget?

00:25:59.083 --> 00:26:01.042
Really? When?

00:26:01.542 --> 00:26:02.625
Tell me.

00:26:05.750 --> 00:26:09.792
The first time you came to my house
and refused to go back to yours,

00:26:11.292 --> 00:26:13.708
that was our first marriage.

00:26:16.542 --> 00:26:20.208
And then, when you
accepted my house as yours.

00:26:22.875 --> 00:26:26.417
And when we had our first fight
over the closet, then too.

00:26:28.792 --> 00:26:31.792
And when you tried to find
a henna artist on our honeymoon…

00:26:35.750 --> 00:26:37.917
Hey, I'm just kidding. Come on.

00:26:39.125 --> 00:26:41.375
Since when did you start making jokes?

00:26:41.458 --> 00:26:42.667
Eight years ago.

00:26:44.500 --> 00:26:46.167
I had the best teacher, you know.

00:27:06.958 --> 00:27:08.250
Should we sit for a bit?

00:27:08.917 --> 00:27:10.000
Yeah?

00:27:28.583 --> 00:27:30.000
Can I ask you something?

00:27:31.167 --> 00:27:32.958
Why did you suddenly think of me?

00:27:34.542 --> 00:27:36.250
I'm moving to Singapore.

00:27:37.667 --> 00:27:38.625
Oh!

00:27:42.833 --> 00:27:44.083
Singapore.

00:27:45.042 --> 00:27:46.833
Always on the move, huh?

00:27:49.042 --> 00:27:52.250
- Are you going alone or…?
- Vineet. My partner.

00:27:52.833 --> 00:27:55.250
He's got everything set up in Singapore.

00:28:05.708 --> 00:28:07.042
I don't know, Chander.

00:28:08.875 --> 00:28:11.833
Something's been pulling at me for weeks.

00:28:12.583 --> 00:28:16.833
Pulling me here, toward you.

00:28:19.250 --> 00:28:23.625
You know, everything is exactly
how I planned it.

00:28:24.542 --> 00:28:25.708
In fact, even better.

00:28:28.250 --> 00:28:30.167
But why doesn't it feel right?

00:28:32.917 --> 00:28:35.042
Every time I try to think about it,

00:28:35.667 --> 00:28:37.750
the thought of you crosses my mind.

00:28:39.292 --> 00:28:41.458
Did I make the right choice?

00:28:42.375 --> 00:28:43.708
For myself.

00:28:45.250 --> 00:28:46.667
For you.

00:28:50.750 --> 00:28:53.417
- Sorry, I've said too much, haven't I?
- No, I'm listening.

00:28:58.125 --> 00:29:00.292
I've been keeping something from you.

00:29:00.375 --> 00:29:01.583
What now?

00:29:03.917 --> 00:29:07.583
I've visited Musafir Cafe before.

00:29:08.958 --> 00:29:10.083
Really?

00:29:11.625 --> 00:29:13.125
- When?
- Three years ago.

00:29:14.708 --> 00:29:17.833
<i>I read a post on Facebook</i>
<i>that Preeti probably wrote.</i>

00:29:18.333 --> 00:29:19.917
<i>She writes beautifully.</i>

00:29:20.000 --> 00:29:23.083
<i>I just couldn't stop myself.</i>
<i>So, I came.</i>

00:29:23.875 --> 00:29:26.958
<i>To visit the place and see you.</i>

00:29:27.750 --> 00:29:29.458
<i>But I couldn't come inside.</i>

00:29:30.125 --> 00:29:31.917
<i>Seeing you guys, I felt like</i>

00:29:32.583 --> 00:29:36.125
<i>maybe you found the love</i>
<i>that's right for you.</i>

00:29:44.708 --> 00:29:46.917
You should've met me, Sudha.

00:29:50.917 --> 00:29:53.917
I actually came to Bombay too.
To see you.

00:29:55.167 --> 00:29:56.292
When?

00:29:56.375 --> 00:30:01.292
Two months after you left me.

00:30:03.500 --> 00:30:05.667
<i>I even got your address from Gargi.</i>

00:30:06.292 --> 00:30:08.542
<i>I told her not to say anything to you.</i>

00:30:10.792 --> 00:30:12.167
<i>I came to apologize.</i>

00:30:12.792 --> 00:30:15.167
<i>I shouldn't have called your house.</i>

00:30:16.042 --> 00:30:17.542
<i>I was so ashamed.</i>

00:30:17.625 --> 00:30:19.250
<i>I… I still am.</i>

00:30:21.958 --> 00:30:23.542
<i>When I woke up the next day,</i>

00:30:23.625 --> 00:30:26.667
<i>I didn't understand</i>
<i>what I had done or why.</i>

00:30:26.750 --> 00:30:27.875
<i>Just…</i>

00:30:36.667 --> 00:30:38.000
I'm so sorry.

00:30:41.292 --> 00:30:42.417
Actually…

00:30:43.375 --> 00:30:45.208
Mom didn't mind at all.

00:30:47.375 --> 00:30:49.542
She completely understood why you called.

00:30:52.792 --> 00:30:53.708
Well…

00:30:56.083 --> 00:30:57.417
thank goodness.

00:30:59.042 --> 00:31:00.167
How is she?

00:31:11.083 --> 00:31:12.417
Sudha?

00:31:14.625 --> 00:31:16.333
Mom used to say

00:31:17.917 --> 00:31:22.125
that someone's presence affects us
just as much

00:31:23.833 --> 00:31:25.250
as their absence.

00:31:32.500 --> 00:31:34.167
I'm so sorry, Sudha.

00:31:36.333 --> 00:31:38.375
You should have met me, Chander.

00:31:45.875 --> 00:31:48.125
When I saw you outside the court that day,

00:31:49.000 --> 00:31:50.542
you were so happy.

00:31:54.083 --> 00:31:56.542
Maybe it was the joy of winning a case,
I don't know.

00:31:57.542 --> 00:31:59.708
But that was the first time I realized

00:32:00.542 --> 00:32:01.708
you were right.

00:32:07.208 --> 00:32:09.958
I could never accept you as you were.

00:32:17.625 --> 00:32:19.250
I do agree, you know?

00:32:22.417 --> 00:32:26.958
There's a kind of magic in these mountains
that you'll never find in the city.

00:32:47.417 --> 00:32:49.667
Chander, nothing needs to change.

00:32:55.667 --> 00:33:02.125
<i>Even every breath is filled with aching</i>

00:33:02.625 --> 00:33:09.542
<i>Where can I search for solace now?</i>

00:33:10.625 --> 00:33:17.000
<i>The distance your love has left between us</i>

00:33:17.542 --> 00:33:23.583
<i>Is where my pain has found its home</i>

00:33:25.750 --> 00:33:31.292
<i>If only I were yours</i>

00:33:32.125 --> 00:33:38.500
<i>If only every wound had healed</i>

00:33:40.000 --> 00:33:46.625
<i>Oh, if only you were mine</i>

00:33:47.333 --> 00:33:54.000
<i>If only fate had spared us this untiming</i>

00:34:15.875 --> 00:34:17.792
Thank you for a memorable Monday, Chander.

00:34:22.875 --> 00:34:24.500
I'm heading back tomorrow morning.

00:34:28.708 --> 00:34:30.042
So, I guess…

00:34:32.208 --> 00:34:33.375
Sorry.

00:34:54.625 --> 00:34:56.500
I guess you're running away
once again, Sudha.

00:35:02.167 --> 00:35:03.250
What?

00:35:10.542 --> 00:35:13.875
<i>Of unspoken dreams</i>

00:35:13.958 --> 00:35:17.875
<i>And promises left half-written</i>

00:35:17.958 --> 00:35:23.500
<i>Their echo still lingers in my heart</i>

00:35:25.708 --> 00:35:28.917
<i>The road keeps whispering to us</i>

00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:32.833
<i>To remain forever wanderers</i>

00:35:32.917 --> 00:35:38.500
<i>For the journey still goes on</i>

00:35:40.667 --> 00:35:46.000
<i>I'll look for healing</i>

00:35:46.083 --> 00:35:48.167
<i>In my dreams</i>

00:35:48.250 --> 00:35:54.250
<i>In a world</i>
<i>Where you're still with me, my love</i>

00:35:55.208 --> 00:35:56.708
Please tell me the truth.

00:36:00.316 --> 00:36:01.542
Why have you come back?

00:36:04.750 --> 00:36:06.621
Because it feels like
I've left something behind.

00:36:17.208 --> 00:36:19.042
The last time you walked away,

00:36:20.208 --> 00:36:21.542
you said, "Chander…

00:36:23.708 --> 00:36:26.333
who said true love is right for us?"

00:36:28.583 --> 00:36:30.583
You never gave me a chance to answer.

00:36:34.875 --> 00:36:37.125
Love doesn't understand
right or wrong, Sudha.

00:36:39.792 --> 00:36:42.375
How can love itself be right or wrong?

00:36:42.458 --> 00:36:43.542
Chander, please.

00:36:45.333 --> 00:36:48.292
You show up whenever you want,

00:36:49.500 --> 00:36:51.208
and walk away whenever you please.

00:36:52.292 --> 00:36:56.875
And you say so casually
that nothing needs to change.

00:37:00.875 --> 00:37:03.042
How do you do it, Sudha?

00:37:06.833 --> 00:37:10.250
And how can you decide everything
by yourself every single time?

00:37:16.208 --> 00:37:17.333
Not this time.

00:37:20.500 --> 00:37:22.208
This time, I'll make the decision.

00:37:24.250 --> 00:37:25.458
For myself…

00:37:27.833 --> 00:37:28.917
and for us.

00:37:41.125 --> 00:37:42.208
Sudha.

00:37:43.917 --> 00:37:44.875
Chander.

00:37:54.708 --> 00:37:55.750
Excuse me.

00:37:56.750 --> 00:38:00.333
Hi. Is this the Musafir Artist Residency?

00:38:00.417 --> 00:38:02.833
It is. Do you have a reservation?

00:38:03.792 --> 00:38:08.083
No, my partner-- I mean,
my girlfriend, Sudha, made one.

00:38:11.917 --> 00:38:13.583
Vineet?

00:40:43.375 --> 00:40:45.375
Subtitle translation by: Neha Nair


